                        ],
                        "form": "die Polemiker"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                        "entry_id": "8b116330-b9af-36d2-b4f7-bc08938494d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die sich gerne der Polemik bedient"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90ba0afb-c2dd-4b2a-bd9d-0187e53f724b",
                                "sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                                "text": "Hans Müller ist ein begnadeter und gnadenloser Polemiker."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c406a550-8f7d-4738-acdc-093acb33d956",
                                "sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                                "text": "Der Polemiker wetterte gegen die neuesten Sparbeschlüsse der Regierung."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce627ae7-cc39-43a6-a424-0381654ea907",
                                "sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                                "text": "„Das höhnische Lachen des Polemikers ist verstummt, und das belustigte Lächeln des Humoristen wird sichtbar.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17984b3d-dfc8-4016-bae9-723f8af7a90b",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b116330-b9af-36d2-b4f7-bc08938494d1",
                        "source_sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich gerne der Polemik bedient",
                        "target_lang_word": "polemic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "polemic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48ba5160-9c95-3bf6-b743-f7bba5104093",
                                        "entry_id": "e8ec1fa1-70e9-35c3-a9e3-08b998b20700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who writes in support of one opinion, doctrine, or system, in opposition to another; one skilled in polemics; a controversialist; a disputant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d56bad9-96ac-35e0-b56b-2792054505f9",
                                        "entry_id": "e8ec1fa1-70e9-35c3-a9e3-08b998b20700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An argument or controversy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71699d07-e3ff-309b-b58a-9a658d0711bb",
                                        "entry_id": "e8ec1fa1-70e9-35c3-a9e3-08b998b20700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strong verbal or written attack on someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "polemic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "feab00b9-d0f8-30bc-9cbc-3465042d8f75",
                                        "entry_id": "cd2847f9-bf09-3cc2-9098-5e6dbc57c926",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the characteristics of a polemic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81841ca2-bb90-4b9d-ad37-ffe2e7a4a6b0",
                                                "sense_id": "feab00b9-d0f8-30bc-9cbc-3465042d8f75",
                                                "text": "A fourth hindrance is by some held to be, that many of our polemic publications are too polemic. Some hold that we should urge the simple Gospel, and make no attack on Hinduism or Muhammadanism ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12fd80b1-92a2-42ed-983c-0d041a78c8b8",
                                                "sense_id": "feab00b9-d0f8-30bc-9cbc-3465042d8f75",
                                                "text": "To explain some of these challenges, it is useful to take a brief and polemic look at the one area that is perhaps most fundamentally affected by the new conditions: the workplace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4808e0f7-046c-4a68-8ee4-2b4c089feff0",
                                                "sense_id": "feab00b9-d0f8-30bc-9cbc-3465042d8f75",
                                                "text": "Using a rather polemic tone, Mutua (2002) argues that interpretations of human rights are not neutral but very much embedded in cultural and political assumptions"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f3611da-0dda-41a6-af48-df8c7457251e",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b116330-b9af-36d2-b4f7-bc08938494d1",
                        "source_sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich gerne der Polemik bedient",
                        "target_lang_word": "controverter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "controverter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb8fc189-4cee-3f68-9b87-ac7a47100ff9",
                                        "entry_id": "dbbaf215-382b-3935-ac74-d569f3e9cd5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who controverts; a controversial writer; a controversialist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17e9969c-d89b-4efa-983d-bfb75e223efd",
                                                "sense_id": "bb8fc189-4cee-3f68-9b87-ac7a47100ff9",
                                                "text": "Some controverters in divinity are like swaggerers in a tavern."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "051af9eb-e216-4303-b124-3a2111e2c869",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b116330-b9af-36d2-b4f7-bc08938494d1",
                        "source_sense_id": "07f9daf3-a87e-35c2-b8aa-c14291bed22a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich gerne der Polemik bedient",
                        "target_lang_word": "polémiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "polémiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f259f2ce-15da-3e47-8628-bd2e8cfee44d",
                                        "entry_id": "f1656ac0-431a-3871-b5a4-99e4a37aeaa0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui pratique la polémique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0beec4d1-3f34-4134-bc12-cc4c452a4a2a",
                                                "sense_id": "f259f2ce-15da-3e47-8628-bd2e8cfee44d",
                                                "text": "J’ai beaucoup lu sur Péguy, ce fils de rempailleuse de chaises devenu Normalien, dreyfusard acharné, socialiste de sang et de flammes, polémiste frontal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a0a3ead-d4c8-4e15-9b60-6d356d3d4d7b",
                                                "sense_id": "f259f2ce-15da-3e47-8628-bd2e8cfee44d",
                                                "text": "Car Dworkin possède à la fois le tempérament de la polémiste et la rigueur de la théoricienne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60a1ce95-73db-41f1-b70d-dd60d03032ab",
                                                "sense_id": "f259f2ce-15da-3e47-8628-bd2e8cfee44d",
                                                "text": "Le polémiste doit au Trésor public plus de 65 000 euros d'amendes liées à ses condamnations pour propos antisémites. Dieudonné poste régulièrement des vidéos sur Internet sous forme d'appels aux dons, soit pour l'aider à payer ses amendes, soit, comme l'an dernier, pour l'aider à racheter sa maison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
